[Music]  Kim Kardashian and Kanye West had a  scary Friday morning and it just like  hit me like where the biggest target  ever a spokesperson for the Los Angeles  Police Department confirmed to et that  around 510 on Friday morning they  received a call about a car theft on the  couple's property the spokesperson told  ET that a witness saw a suspect enter  the car and take personal items before  exiting the car and fleeing the scene  adding that a second suspect who was  hiding in some bushes also took off as  of Friday morning no arrests have been  made but the investigation is ongoing a  source close to Kim tells et that the  car belonged to a staff member not Kim  or Kanye and was parked at the bottom of  the driveway according to the source the  thief tried to take something from the  car and was startled by multiple  security guards with guns drawn  meanwhile another source tells et that  Kim and Kanye's neighbor comedian Kathy  Griffin also had items stolen from a car  in front of her home on Friday morning  the burglary comes just one year after  Kardashian was robbed at gunpoint in  Paris it just opened up my eyes that  this happens and that there's you know  really bad people in this world I could  still live my life but just on edge  [Music]

